 "name": "S15: Ch5, Managing managers, managing out + exercises",
 "text_content": "Pages 449 to 483. Chapter 5: Managing managers, Managing out, firing, and layoffs, Some final thoughts on management, plus the Chapter 5 exercises appendix.\n\nS\u014fn output (draft): manager development, and the separation protocol.\n\nAdaptation required: her layoff material assumes a funded company contracting. A restaurant's version is seasonal, and its firing bar is legally and practically different in Texas than in her context. Build the protocol S\u014fn will actually use. Flag anything that needs counsel rather than resolving it here.",
